# Embed-asset upgrade blocklist — one <base> per line to HOLD a renet-embedded
# binary at its current Dockerfile pin instead of tracking upstream latest.
#
# Base names match the Dockerfile ARG <BASE>_VERSION, lowercased:
#   criu rsync rclone zot k3s csiprovisioner csisnapshotter snapshotcontroller
#
# Each entry needs a substantive BLOCKER reason (>=30 chars, no banned phrases),
# exactly like every other suppression list in this repo. Format:
#
#   # BLOCKER: <why this component is pinned back and when to revisit>
#   <base>
#
# Empty by default — nothing is held; every pin tracks upstream.
